WEBVTT

NOTE
Disc 2 - Scene 28h: Ellone Activates Her Time-Traveling Power
Duration: ~23 seconds
Lunar Base Ruins / Ragnarok - A Lifeline From The Past
For blind and low-vision players using screen readers

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
From somewhere distant — either the Lunar Base or aboard the Ragnarok airship — Ellone's 
presence manifests. Ellone is a young woman with short, shoulder-length brown hair. Her 
expression is focused and determined. She wears her characteristic clothing and stands with 
purpose.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Ellone raises her hands before her, palms outward. A brilliant aura of energy surrounds her 
body, glowing with ethereal blue-white light. Her power activates — the rare ability to send 
people's consciousness backward through time itself.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Concentric rings of energy radiate outward from Ellone's position, like ripples in water 
expanding in all directions. The waves of power are visible and tangible, distorting the 
space around them. Her connection to the timestream is absolute and unmistakable.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
The energy pulses forward, reaching toward Ultimecia's consciousness. Ellone's power grabs 
hold of the future Sorceress and begins pulling her backward through the corridors of time. 
Ultimecia's consciousness is dragged further and further into the past, deeper into her 
own future.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
With each wave of Ellone's power, reality shivers. The distinction between past and future 
blurs. Ellone's sacrifice — sending her own consciousness into danger to perform this feat — 
is the key that allows Time Compression to begin. Her power is the only tool that can reach 
Ultimecia across the vastness of time.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.000
The Time Compression begins to take hold, pulled forward by Ultimecia's consciousness being 
pushed backward. The paradox is set in motion — the heroes' only chance to reach their 
enemy in her own era depends on this moment.
